OL,3,GNEWSAStar Wars and Strictly film
OL,4,Astudios could be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilm studios where movies and
OL,7,Ftelevision programmes such as Star Wars
OL,8,Fand Strictly Come Dancing have been
OL,9,Fproduced could be sold off.
OL,11,FHertsmere Borough Council, which owns
OL,12,FElstree Studios, said it did not have
OL,13,Fthe funds to repair and maintain the
OL,14,Fsite.
OL,16,FThe authority said it was also
OL,17,Fconsidering offering a long lease or
OL,18,Ffinding a partner for a joint venture.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
