OL,3,GNEWSAStar Wars and Strictly film
OL,4,Astudios could be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the council said the
OL,7,Foption of a sale had to "be on the
OL,8,Ftable" but "the very first principle"
OL,9,Fof the plan for the future was for
OL,10,Ffilming to continue at the site.
